    "detailed_description": "Learn to DJ on official Pioneer DJ equipment. Join the daily workshops. Connect with our community. Level up your skills. Perform to the world.<br><br>Start your <strong>FREE 7 DAY TRIAL SUBSCRIPTION</strong><br>- Play on official Pioneer DJ equipment<br>- Load your own music - including via Dropbox<br>- Access tracks from Monstercat <br>- Stream from TIDAL/Soundcloud Go+ <br>- Join live workshops - more than 30 per week<br>- Level up your skills with game mode tutorials<br>- Livestream to Twitch<br>- Join multiplayer rooms and jam together<br><br>If you decide to cancel, no worries, you can keep mixing with a free, limited version of Tribe.<br>- Play with the starter decks<br>- Mix up to 5 tracks per session<br>- Join multiplayer sessions<br>- Continue learning with the 5 day DJ challenge<br>You can always re-subscribe when you\u2019re ready.<br><br>Join the community on Discord | <br><br>Start your DJ journey today!<br><br><strong>***Please be aware: WINDOWS 10 or 11 is REQUIRED to run Tribe.***</strong>",
